{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46207","headline":"山居诗二十四首 二十一 · 贯休","name":"山居诗二十四首 二十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石罏金鼎红蕖嫩，香阁茶棚绿巘齐。\n坞烧崩腾奔涧鼠，岩花狼籍鬬山鸡。\n蒙庄环外知音少，阮籍途穷旨趣低。\n应有世人来觅我，水重山叠几层迷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46207.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46207","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}